  "mission": "ORGANIZER-BOUND-TURNOVER-CLOUD-02",
  "short": "OBTC02",
  "question": "Does the balanced chemostat, with NO added cohesion, produce an X cloud that is bounded relative to the organiser, maintained by a local birth-death flux, traversed by material turnover, causally dependent on the organiser, quantitatively predicted by a source-transport-decay operator, robust to seeds and to domain size, without global saturation and without wall confinement?\n",
