   "base": "BALANCED_CHEMOSTAT",
   "added_cohesion": "NONE",
   "C3_neighbour_protected_decay": "FORBIDDEN",
   "note": "the engine is the frozen ORR01 kinetics with the LawSpec v2 exchange operator. OBTC01 adds instrumentation, a molecular tracker drawing from a separate generator, and two declared interventions. No rate is changed.\n"
